<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said on Thursday Integon Corp, First Data Corp, Petro-Canada Inc preferred p, Conseco Inc preferred d, and Cincinnati Gas and Electric Co were unavailable for news.</p>
<p>Corimon SACA also was unavailable for trading, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
